Context: 5ame·as irr 1, and. 3. above-

It is mandatory on the Ministries / Departments to satisfy following  
conditions before implementing the policy of reservation in promotions:  
- (i)
- Collection of quantifiable data regarding inadequacy of representation of SCs and STs;
- (ii) Application of this data to each cadre separately;
- (iii)
- Maintenance of reservation roster, as per OM, dated 2-7-1997;
- (iv) DPC to assess the suitability of officers being considered for promotion to ensure administrative efficiency.
